<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s296S"><span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s296w1">When all this is happening</span>, the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w8">obstacle</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s296w7">in</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w4"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w5">visual</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w6">consciousness</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s296w3">of</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w2">craving spirit</span> prevents him from <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w12">seeing</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w9"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w11">river</span> of <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w10">water</span></span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s296w13">and so</span> he <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w17">sees</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w15">dry</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w16">parched</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w14">riverbed</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w33">same</span> is true for the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w19"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w20">visual</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w21">consciousness</span></span> of a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w18">human</span>: <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s296w27">if</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w22">obstacle</span> were there, it would prevent him from <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w26">seeing</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w23"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w25">river</span> of <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s296w24">water</span></span>, and then he would <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w32">have to</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w31">see</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s296w29">dry</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l=